properties.description:
QI Tech is the first company to receive the Direct Credit Society (SCD) license from the Central Bank of Brazil and, six years later, in 2024, we became the only unicorn in Latin America.

Since 2018, we have been providing the full technological infrastructure companies need to create and scale financial products and solutions in a highly regulated environment.

Our portfolio includes:

Risk Solutions: anti-fraud tools to protect businesses and their customers;

Banking: full-stack banking APIs — digital accounts, payments, cards, all in white-label format;

Credit: proprietary technology to originate, operate, and securitize credit with full regulatory compliance;

DCM (Capital Markets Platform): an integrated platform for issuing, distributing, and managing capital market transactions;

DTVM: regulatory and technological infrastructure for investment funds.

With a high-performance culture and an unwavering focus on clients, we are the strategic partner for companies that want to innovate with confidence and scale securely.

